## Basic navigation commands

### Super User
#### Activate Super User
$ sudo su
#### Exit Super User 
$ exit

### Folder NAvigation
#### Go to directory
$ cd [directory name]
#### Go one folder Up
$ cd ..


## Files/Folders MAnipulation
### Copy Folder
$ cp [option]



